<section class="section" style="padding-top: 9rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="badge badge-emerald"><i data-lucide="shield-check"></i> GDPR & Google Play Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy & Data Retention Policy</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card prose" style="line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.975rem;">
      <p>
        Beyounge Technologies Inc. ("we", "our", "us") is committed to protecting your privacy, biometrics, and personal health information. This Privacy & Data Retention Policy explains how we collect, use, store, retain, and delete your data when you use the Beyounge mobile application (available on Google Play) and our website at <a href="/" style="color: var(--primary-emerald);">beyounge.app</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only the information necessary to provide AI-driven fitness coaching, nutrition tracking, and health analytics:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account Identifiers:</strong> Name, email address, chosen username/handle, password hash, profile avatar, and account preferences.</li>
        <li><strong>Biometrics & Fitness History:</strong> Height, body weight, exercise sets/reps/loads, rate of perceived exertion (RPE), heart rate variability (HRV), step counts, sleep metrics, and activity logs.</li>
        <li><strong>Nutrition & Meal Photographs:</strong> Meal photos submitted for AI visual macro recognition and caloric logging. Photos are used solely for nutritional analysis.</li>
        <li><strong>Health Connect & Wearable Biometrics:</strong> Biometric data synchronized via Android Health Connect, Google Fit, or supported wearable devices, with your explicit permission.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical & App Diagnostics:</strong> IP address, device model, operating system version, crash reports, and anonymized app usage telemetry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <p>We process your personal data exclusively to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Generate adaptive AI workout routines, progressive overload calculations, and recovery readiness scores.</li>
        <li>Calculate custom calorie, macro, water, and step targets tailored to your physical goals.</li>
        <li>Synchronize your workout history and nutrition logs seamlessly across your registered devices.</li>
        <li>Provide customer support, resolve technical issues, and enforce account security.</li>
        <li>Improve our AI prediction models using aggregated, non-identifiable telemetry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Data Retention & Storage Policy</h2>
      <p>
        In compliance with global data privacy regulations (including GDPR, CCPA, and Google Play User Data Guidelines), Beyounge enforces strict, transparent data retention limits:
      </p>
      
      <h3>3.1 Active Account Retention</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Account & Biometrics Data:</strong> Your account profile, workout history, exercise logs, biometric trends, and macro goals are retained for as long as your Beyounge user account remains active, or as necessary to provide ongoing fitness tracking and AI coaching.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Meal Photographs & Scans:</strong> Images submitted for visual macro tracking are stored for the duration of your active account so you can maintain a personal meal history.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technical Logs & Diagnostics:</strong> Server access logs, crash diagnostics, and anonymized usage analytics are retained for a maximum of <strong>12 months</strong>, after which they are automatically purged or permanently anonymized.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>3.2 Account Inactivity Policy</h3>
      <p>
        If a user account shows no login, sync, or active app usage for <strong>24 consecutive months</strong>, Beyounge classifies the account as inactive. We will issue an advance notice email to the registered address. If the account remains inactive for 30 days following notice, all associated personal identifiers, biometrics, workout records, and photographs will be automatically and permanently deleted from our primary servers.
      </p>

      <h3>3.3 Data Storage & Security Controls</h3>
      <p>
        All user data is encrypted in transit using <strong>TLS 1.3</strong> protocol and encrypted at rest using <strong>AES-256 encryption</strong>. Your biometric and health logs are stored in secure, isolated database systems hosted on enterprise cloud infrastructure with strict access controls.
      </p>

      <h3>3.4 Legal & Financial Retention Exceptions</h3>
      <p>
        Subscription billing records and purchase transactions processed through Google Play Billing are retained for up to <strong>7 years</strong> strictly to comply with legal, tax, accounting, and anti-fraud regulations. <em>Note: Personal health, workout logs, and biometric data are never retained under this statutory tax exception.</em>
      </p>

      <h2>4. Data Deletion Rights & Procedures</h2>
      <p>
        You have the absolute right to request the complete, permanent deletion of your personal data and account history at any time. We provide multiple convenient deletion pathways:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>In-App Immediate Account Deletion:</strong> Open the Beyounge Android App, navigate to <code>Settings &gt; Account &amp; Privacy &gt; Delete Account</code>, and confirm. This triggers immediate account termination and data purge.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Online Web Deletion Portal:</strong> Visit our dedicated <a href="/data-deletion" style="color: var(--primary-emerald); font-weight: 600;">Data Deletion Request Page</a> at <code>/data-deletion</code> to submit a deletion ticket.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email Request:</strong> Contact our Data Protection Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@beyounge.app" style="color: var(--primary-emerald);">privacy@beyounge.app</a> or <a href="mailto:support@beyounge.app" style="color: var(--primary-emerald);">support@beyounge.app</a> with the subject line <em>"Data Deletion Request"</em>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>4.1 Deletion Execution Timeline</h3>
      <p>
        Upon receipt of an account deletion request or in-app account deletion, your personal profile, workout history, biometrics, meal photos, and social posts are <strong>permanently deleted from active production databases within 24 to 48 hours</strong>. Residual automated server backups are completely overwritten and purged within <strong>14 to 30 calendar days</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Health Data & Third-Party Sharing Compliance</h2>
      <p>
        Beyounge maintains a strict <strong>Zero Third-Party Data Sale Policy</strong>:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>We do <strong>never sell, rent, license, or trade</strong> your personal information, biometrics, or health data to third-party advertisers, data brokers, or marketing agencies.</li>
        <li><strong>Android Health Connect & Google Fit Data:</strong> Health and fitness metrics accessed via Google Play Health Connect or Google Fit APIs are used strictly to calculate recovery readiness and fitness insights. We comply fully with Google Play's Health Connect Developer Requirements and never transfer Health Connect data to third parties for advertising or non-health purposes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Beyounge is not directed toward children under the age of 13 (or 16 in the European Union). We do not knowingly collect or maintain personal data from individuals under these ages. If we learn that a minor has created an account, we will promptly delete the account and all associated data.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Privacy Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy & Data Retention Policy periodically to reflect changes in our legal obligations or mobile app features. Material revisions will be highlighted in the app and on our website prior to taking effect.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact Our Data Protection Officer</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy & Data Retention Policy or our handling of your data, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <div style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08); border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-emerald); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); margin-top: 1rem;">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF;">Beyounge Technologies Inc. — Privacy & Data Protection Office</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@beyounge.app" style="color: var(--primary-emerald);">privacy@beyounge.app</a> | <a href="mailto:support@beyounge.app" style="color: var(--primary-emerald);">support@beyounge.app</a></p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--text-secondary);">Data Deletion Web Portal: <a href="/data-deletion" style="color: var(--primary-emerald);">beyounge.app/data-deletion</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

